    {
      "subId": "7514502",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751450201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751450201": {
            "id": "751450201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Chosen One, Chosen of Dragons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450202"
            ]
          },
          "751450202": {
            "id": "751450202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Sacred Mountain lies before you... If... that is... you can eliminate the enemy cloaked in shadow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450203"
            ]
          },
          "751450203": {
            "id": "751450203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Chosen of Dragons... Enter... Enter the Sacred Mountain...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450204"
            ]
          },
          "751450204": {
            "id": "751450204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Roar...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450205"
            ]
          },
          "751450205": {
            "id": "751450205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "D—Did the volcano just... erupt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450206"
            ]
          },
          "751450206": {
            "id": "751450206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No... It's been super duper quiet... D—Did you see it erupt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450207"
            ]
          },
          "751450207": {
            "id": "751450207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}? {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}? What's up? What's with those faces?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450208"
            ]
          },
          "751450208": {
            "id": "751450208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You look like a pair of detectives from a light novel who've suddenly realized the truth about the killer...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450210",
              "751450213"
            ]
          },
          "751450210": {
            "id": "751450210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(You explain what you saw to Paimon...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450211"
            ]
          },
          "751450211": {
            "id": "751450211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Huh? You saw the same stuff you did when we first arrived in Natlan and met {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450218"
            ]
          },
          "751450218": {
            "id": "751450218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And some strange images?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450219"
            ]
          },
          "751450219": {
            "id": "751450219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Ehrr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450220"
            ]
          },
          "751450220": {
            "id": "751450220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You said you saw some strange words before... Umm, Paimon didn't see anything, so she can't be sure, but... might they have been written by the same person?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450221"
            ]
          },
          "751450221": {
            "id": "751450221",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think that's the case, yes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450222"
            ]
          },
          "751450222": {
            "id": "751450222",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, something feels fishy to Paimon... But, this time you also saw... a giant section of ruins, a broken city, and the Abyss...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450223"
            ]
          },
          "751450223": {
            "id": "751450223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And some \"Sacred Mountain\"... Hmm, don't the Natlanese call that volcano the \"Sacred Mountain\"? Could it be that what you saw has something to do with the volcano?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450224"
            ]
          },
          "751450224": {
            "id": "751450224",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Paimon can't shake the feeling that the person who united us with {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} really wants us to go there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450225"
            ]
          },
          "751450225": {
            "id": "751450225",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm. Do you think we can help the little one remove his... what was it called... Flamelord's Blessing? Y'know, if we get to that mountain?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450226"
            ]
          },
          "751450226": {
            "id": "751450226",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450227"
            ]
          },
          "751450227": {
            "id": "751450227",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, let's go there then. Gotta help you grow big and strong, after all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450228"
            ]
          },
          "751450228": {
            "id": "751450228",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh right! One of the six tribes of Natlan, the Collective of Plenty, lives beside the volcano. Maybe we can ask them for help!"
          },
          "751450213": {
            "id": "751450213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450214"
            ]
          },
          "751450214": {
            "id": "751450214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Darn it! How did you know? Paimon was certain no one saw her eating Little Miss Cake... Just kidding, Paimon actually stole the Blazed Meat Stew!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450215"
            ]
          },
          "751450215": {
            "id": "751450215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, you... Wait, what did you just see?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450216"
            ]
          },
          "751450216": {
            "id": "751450216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(You explain what you saw to Paimon...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751450217"
            ]
          },
          "751450217": {
            "id": "751450217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, you saw some weird words again..."
          }
        }
      }
